{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review remediation rounds 2-4 (findings + fixes):\n- P4 oversize: description compressed; evidence detail lives in these comments.\n- G1G2 consumer enumeration: version/blocking-set pins = test_impact_model_versioning.py (2 equality sites + pin) and test_code_review_ws2.py (pin); test_impact_code.py premise rewrites enumerated (test_new_binary_scales_with_churn deleted, freq_mult pair re-targeted to debt binaries, reversibility floor case inverted, cold-debt 0.12->0.24); eval specs enumerated (code-review-tests.eval.yaml, code-review-verify.eval.yaml); ab_impact_model.py listed.\n- G1G2 median invariant: re-verified under v4 over code_review_impact_labels.jsonl: median HIGH 0.90, NIT 0.24, separation 0.66 > 0.30, NIT < 0.30 — holds (max NIT rises 0.12->0.24 from amplifier-only cold debt, still under).\n- G6 trigger overload: resolved as two lane-scoped maps over the one field — prod {common 1.0, sometimes 0.6, rare 0.25} unchanged; moderate-maint {rare 0.75, else 1.0}; impact_base = max over lane bases, each with its own mult.\n- G6 prod_impact none=test-only clause: the re-scope REPLACES that clause for coverage/contract findings (rate the guarded path's reach, not the diff's file type). Crosstab evidence that verifiers already answer this way: of 1664 tests findings, prod=none 862 / low 258 / medium 49 / high 21 / unset 474; the med/high tail was hand-read as load-bearing, the none/low mass as internal edges. Verify-eval fire case additionally pins prod_impact != none.\n- G6 moderate top-out (advisory): moderate maint blocks only via amp 1.0; 88% of tests findings (1466/1670) carry escapes_automation/silent_failure, so the intended class reaches 0.60 >= 0.54; non-silent moderate tops at 0.48 deliberately (already-detected gaps).\n- Blocking path breakdown of the 47 newly-blocking tests findings: 20 moderate-maint amp1.0, 18 serious-maint amp1.0, 5 prod amp1.0, 4 serious-maint amp0.8."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787198485740859001,"uuid":"af072d06-fc6d-4e88-a985-6c021e06cdab"}